    "title": "China's Macro Economy Is Staggering: Expert",
    "text": "Golden Week, China’s National Day holiday, used to be the country's big travel and spending season before the pandemic. So what’s it like this year? Where does China’s economy stand overall? NTD spoke with Christopher Balding for his take.\nBalding was a professor at Peking University’s HSBC School of Business until 2018, when he was fired for pushing back against censorship. Now he’s the founder of Siphtor, a smart social media platform, and New Kite Data Labs, a think tank focused on China, data, technology, and the economy.",
